{"title":"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3(Video_solution_using_[The_Apple_Method])\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3(Video solution using [The Apple Method])</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/37798c2fd22539040e3a6401a3849d5de18df665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 1 = b + 2 = c + 3 = d + 4 = a + b + c + d + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"389\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4e7cee8fe39683f5495d0b4daf7056f4a964643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c + d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/0408fdb0ebee9699cc371a6553ccea080a7844d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -5 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -10/3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ -7/3 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 5/3 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/28184d1392b9cc70daf5d2563f9f1be67c4d8112.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a + 1 = b + 2 = c + 3 = d + 4 = a + b + c + d + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"423\" height=\"14\" />. Since one of the sums involves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d02bb2275100261109b043261e702124460a83e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/9234823c756646d3c67387b3f73375eed1aebd6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> it makes sense to consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/552a48d02c71f777e5fe4e7a35ff0271964b2e34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x=(a+1)+(b+2)+(c+3)+(d+4)=a+b+c+d+10=4(a+b+c+d)+20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"681\" height=\"18\" />. Rearranging, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bfd1c4e4bf3913ac5f50ee548618dab77f6a353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(a+b+c+d)=-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/d/95db23f053189a4530c4ebeba9c5f2978851768c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d=\\frac{-10}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"160\" height=\"37\" />. Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd5904c715051d2b0c600bcf67eba46a274d1a6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ -10/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"100\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Take \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0bac2aef60699c8fe9a2d33b862977c46d6fa783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 1 = a + b + c + d + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"197\" height=\"14\" />.\nNow we can clearly see:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/846efd3b5e01c00a7a5d04a3cae5c8787635e4e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4 = b + c + d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" />.\nContinuing this same method with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94c2cf5ae960b0f03261a5e1ff0187aa1fc6aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 2, c + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/2/a42afe6ae85fb64373dc67f6386e40bce3c149dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/846efd3b5e01c00a7a5d04a3cae5c8787635e4e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4 = b + c + d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9863bf921ce04889df1fe80e2745169f438d57b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3 = a + c + d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"14\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e31f2e45978ff53a9b1f3ca4caa56662ed23826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 = a + b + d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"119\" height=\"14\" />, and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c0236a68a92375074ecfbd3046f9569b07b6d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 = a + b + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />,\nAdding, we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43eb8f8696e3f9df291d1d4eb6db398cd7f84944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10 = 3a + 3b + 3c + 3d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51df8bb1c5f65de6011524dc2e3fc4a4dbbff3e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c + d = \\boxed{\\frac{-10}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"173\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3.28Video_solution_using_.5BThe_Apple_Method.5D.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3(Video_solution_using_[The_Apple_Method])\">Solution 3(Video solution using [The Apple Method])</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3(Video solution using [The Apple Method])\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rz86M2hlOGk&amp;feature=emb_logo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rz86M2hlOGk&amp;feature=emb_logo</a>\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NRdOxPUDngI\">https://youtu.be/NRdOxPUDngI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tKsYSBdeVuw?t=4105\">https://youtu.be/tKsYSBdeVuw?t=4105</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/X1pdpIGSFRU\">https://youtu.be/X1pdpIGSFRU</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:c